{"id":"1827d5ca5ea813ed","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-separation-of-relations.md","title":"Separation of Subsets","display":"df-separation-of-relations — Separation of Subsets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-separation-of-relations","aliases":["68-df-separation-of-relations"],"display":"df-separation-of-relations — Separation of Subsets","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 p.77 / PDF 86, definition preceding 20.4","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-separation-of-relations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-separation-of-relations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-separation-of-relations — Separation of Subsets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 p.77 / PDF 86, definition preceding 20.4"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq X\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A,B,C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A,B,C)\\)</span> 为下式引入的谓词，第三个参数为分离集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A,B,C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\subseteq C\\land B\\subseteq X\\setminus C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A,B,C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\subseteq C\\land B\\subseteq X\\setminus C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定义及参数顺序显式化。此性质蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>；分离不是把 C 要求成 A 与 B 之间的非空真子集，空集合等退化情形均允许。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A,B,C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A,B,C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\subseteq C\\land B\\subseteq X\\setminus C.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\cap B=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":994,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb520eeb2ca8e0fc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X=X_{m,k}$；$A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)$。$\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]，$\\operatorname{Separates}_X$ 见 [[68-df-separation-of-relations]]。"},{"id":"2b92bd908c1baefd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-separation-of-relations]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-separation-of-relations]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-separation-of-relations|df-separation-of-relations — Separation of Subsets]]"}],"outgoing":[]}